{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive\/checkifeligibleforsurvey"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive","doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"}],"modules":[{"name":"EXPPredictive"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)EXPPredictive(cm)checkIfEligibleForSurvey","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"abstract":[{"text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited to a survey.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to be eligible, a number of conditions must be fulfilled:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The library is in an enabled state. If the user has previously declined an invite"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or completed a survey, the library will be in a disabled state. Otherwise, the library is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"in an enabled state."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user has met the loyalty threshold defined in your exp_configuration.json file."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user is in the sampling pool. If the previous two conditions have been met, the library"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"makes an HTTP call to our servers to determine if the user is in the sampling pool. If s\/he is,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the invite will be presented. If not, the invite will not be shown. Disable this remote check with"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive\/checkIfEligibleForSurvey","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive/EXPPredictive/checkIfEligibleForSurvey":{"abstract":[{"text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited to a survey.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","url":"\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive\/checkifeligibleforsurvey","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive\/checkIfEligibleForSurvey","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive":{"title":"EXPPredictive","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive","url":"\/documentation\/exppredictive","role":"collection","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"},"setSkipPoolingCheck:":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","type":"text"}],"identifier":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","title":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","type":"link","url":"setSkipPoolingCheck:"},"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive/EXPPredictive":{"url":"\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The EXPPredictive class provides the main interface to the Verint EXPPredictive module. You must add a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"exp_configuration.json"},{"type":"text","text":" file to your project that defines the behavior of the Trigger module (e.g. defines the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"triggering criteria for inviting a user to participate in a survey)."}],"title":"EXPPredictive","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"EXPPredictive","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive","kind":"symbol"}}}